{
  "_comment": [
    "Demo 01 'Frozen Lake' tutorial steps, beats A0-A2 + the A6 cover sample (docs/demo/DEMO01_BEAT_SHEET.md section 4). Read at runtime by UTutorialSubsystem",
    "(the level JSON 'demo': {'tutorial': true, 'tutorial_steps': 'demo_01_steps.json'} selects this file). Schema: HANDOFF section 6 'Tutorial'.",
    "Texts are ids only (TUT_*, WT_*, OBJ_*): English text comes from the narrative manifest 'tutorial' section (TANDEM request #17), else",
    "Content/Data/Tutorial/demo_01_texts_draft.json, else '[EN missing: <id>]'. Command ids: Source/CodexTactics/Public/Core/PlayerCommands.h.",
    "Volume ids (VOL_*) are the VolumeId / StepId of ATutorialTriggerVolume actors placed in L_Demo01_A_FrozenLake:",
    "VOL_A0_BEACON1 (BeatId A1), VOL_A1_HUT (inside the fishing hut with the heat-pack crate), VOL_A1_BEACON2 (the crack: solo point), VOL_A1_BEACON3,",
    "VOL_A1_BEACON4, VOL_A1_RIDGE, VOL_A1_RIDGE_FAR, VOL_A2_CAMP (BeatId A2), VOL_A6_FIELD (the A6 ridge field entrance).",
    "A0-A1 order (user decision 2026-10-12): sprint is LOCKED from A0 (sprinting warms, so a sprinter would never meet the cold lesson) ->",
    "camera -> beacon 1 -> select / box select -> hut: open the crate, take the heat packs (the squad starts with none: level JSON",
    "squad_loadout.heat_packs_count 0) -> solo at the crack (wind zone + the gust safety) -> heat pack on the coldest -> 'Warmed up' -> sprint unlocked.",
    "Cover events (raised when an operative SETTLES in a slot, not on the order): CoverEntered (+ .High / .Low), CoverShimmy, CornerReached, CoverLeft;",
    "'distinct_operatives': true counts each operative once. Loot: command Loot.Open (crate opened), event ItemLooted.<Item> (ItemLooted.HeatPack).",
    "Heat pack used: event ItemUsed.HEAT_PACK (U key and a pack dragged onto a cold mate). Locked command tried: event Tutorial.Locked.<CommandId>."
  ],
